window.products.push({"id":577119,"name":"2 Packs Sphere Silicone Mold Large, 6 Holes Silicone Round Molds For Hot Chocolate Bomb, Cake, Jelly, Pudding, Handmade Soap, Round Shape Half Sphere ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DDcyX6c1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: - Mold Size: 11.4’’ x 6.7’’ (29cm / x 17cm) and the diameter of each cavity is 2.5’’ / 7cm.  - Material: Silicone  - Color: Pink Features: -Safe to use in ovens, microwave ovens, dishwasher and freezer.  -Easy to pop the chocolate out.  -Dishwasher-Proof & Dishwasher Safe.  -6-cavity design, can be used for making cupcake toppers, edibles, chocolate snacks, Chocolate bombs, hard candy, fondant, butter patties, cake decorations and more. Tips: - When you make the cake, please do not pure full cake slurry into the molds, just make it 3/4 full. The cake will expand when making. Notes for use: 1. When baking, it's better to put the mold in the flat baking tray as the silicone mold is soft.  2. After baking, please remove the mold out of the oven, and place in the baking rack until the mold completely cooled.  3. After use, please clean it using hot water with a dilute edible cleaning agent or put it in the dishwasher. Ensure that the silicone molds are dry before storage.  4. Please do not use cool water to clean immediately when it's just taken out of the oven. Just to extend the service life. Package Includes: 2x Silicone Molds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DDcyX6c1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrillianTee","source_asin":"B08QG9T3DP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QG9T3DP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QG9T3DP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
