window.products.push({"id":577167,"name":"vfaejll Beige Wall Collage Kit Aesthetic Pictures, Room Decor for Teen Girls Bedroom Aesthetic, Photo Wall Collage Kit, Collage Kit for Wall Aesthetic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mJWZ6cZkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peach teal style aesthetic collage kit contains images with a glamorous, elegant, positive, sassy, happy, silent vibe. You can use this wall decorations to decorate your bedroom, living room, dining room, baby bedroom or any wall. Specifications: Material: matte paper. Quantity: 50pcs Poster. Package Contents: 50pcs Poster+1*tape. Size: each card measures approx. 4x6inch/10x15cm. Suited for: college students, girls and boys,scrapbook lovers. Scope of application: Wall stickers, photo frames, halls, bedrooms, desktops, etc. Aesthetic collage kits can decorate your place in various ways. 1: The most popular way is stick them on the wall without gap, then they become a photo wall. 2: Hang these posters into a banner, you can hang them vertically and horizontally. 3.Covers Around 3 FT x 3 FT of Space when put up edge to edge. You can put them in collage frame. Product Description: 1.Vibrant Orange and Blue Wall Collage Kit - Turn that boring old wall in your room into a creative masterpiece using the trendy aesthetic peach teal photo collage kit. The perfect indie room decor choice to spice up your bedroom, dorm or bathroom walls, while creating a unique colorful scenery. 2.Peach Teal Theme - The wall collage kit is filled with bright orange and blue colors, and glowing sparkly aesthetic prints. Feel free to decorate your room however you like, you can overlap the prints, frame them, add in your own photos or anything else you can think of! Aesthetic photos will transform and brighten the look of your room and wall. 3.Gift - It will make an excellent gift for girls and young women! These are great gifts for birthdays, graduations, Christmas and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mJWZ6cZkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vfaejll","source_asin":"B09KRN5QV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KRN5QV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KRN5QV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
