window.products.push({"id":577214,"name":"Electric Wine Opener Automatic Corkscrew Wine Bottle Opener Set with Charger, Foil Cutter, Wine Aerator Pourer, Vacuum Stopper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gmRQdjbJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Bluesea Electric Wine Opener Rechargeable with Charger & Foil Cutter Automatic Corkscrew Wine Bottle Opener Cordless Wine Gift Set IMPORTANT TIPS 1. Before using this electric wine opener, please Rotate the top cap counterclockwise and remove the \"White Label\" on the top of wine opener. Then tighten the top cap clockwise .2. Just press the \"Down Button\" to take the cork out of wine bottles, Push \"Up Button\" to remove the cork from wine opener.3. When wine opener did not work , it means it is low power and you need to charge it fully.It usually takes abour 4-6 hours to fully charge .4. If you charge it, it still not work , just message us on Amazon for free replacement .5.The battery can be recharged and replaced by AA battery , The “+” “-”poles of the battery are aligned with the “+” “-”poles of the bottle opener Bluesea Electric Wine Bottle Openers is perfect for you. 1. Cordless rechargeable electric bottle opener removes one cork in 7 seconds .2. Built-in rechargeable battery, this electric wine opener opens up to 70 wine bottles on a single full charge(4-6 hours)3. Push \"Down Button\" to take the cork out of wine bottles, Push \"Up Button\" to remove the cork from wine opener. How To Open a Wine Bottle 1. Easily remove the seal with the included foil cutter. 2. One hand hold the bottle firmly, another hand hold the lower part button of electric wine opener to remove the cork from bottle. The electric corkscrew will spiral down to enter the cork, keep pressing until the cork out of bottle.3. Remove the cork from the wine opener by pressing the upper part button--the electric corkscrew turns in the opposite direction to release the cork. Package: 1x Electric Wine Opener1x Foil Cutter1x Charger1x Wine Aerator Pourer1x Vacuum Stopper1x Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gmRQdjbJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bluesea","source_asin":"B07MYXPGCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MYXPGCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MYXPGCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
