window.products.push({"id":577229,"name":"GINGPROUS Christmas Funny Wine Tumbler Set, 12 Oz Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler for Women Friends Men, Gift Idea for Christmas Xmas Wedding Party, Set ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X4HBjYaVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT GIFT FOR MANY OCCASIONS: The funny wine tumbler is great christmas gift, birthday gift ideas for yourself, your female best friends, besties, BFF, cousin, girl friends, mom, wife, grandma, gigi, nana, aunt, daughter, teacher, niece, nurses, neighbors. This stainless steel tumbler will thrill the lucky recipient! GOOD INSULATION: The Insulated tumbler is with Double-Wall vacuum technology to keep drinks hot for over 3 hours and cold for around 9 hours. This fun and unique tumbler makes the perfect companion for any drinks. SAFE AND DURABLE: The wine glasses is made from high quality 18/8 304 food grade stainless steel. Lead free and durable, easy to wash. It is reusable, does not rust or leave a bad metallic taste in the mouth. Let you enjoy a delicious drink better. EASY TO CLEAN SPLASH-PROOF LID: The crystal clear and BPA free lid with ring gasket tightly covers the stainless steel tumbler free lid to prevent spills. Suggest to wash the tumbler with our equipped cup brush without affecting the pattern and easy to clean. USED INDOOR & OUTDOOR: Our stemless wine tumbler is suitable for any indoor or outdoor places. Perfect for enjoying drinks at home, on the beach, by the lake, at the pool, in the office, at the party, during RV tours, cabin trip, camping, hiking, picnic and so on. Enjoy the time of drinking without other concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X4HBjYaVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GINGPROUS","source_asin":"B07XK759H5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XK759H5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XK759H5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577230,"name":"New 11x14 Photo: President George Washington,\"Father of Our Country\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FPlTWc+FL._AC_.jpg","description":"New borderless print measures 11\" x 14\" (approximate). Our prints are custom made-to-order using a gloss finish on heavy-weight photographic paper. Print is also coated for water-resistance and acid free to prevent yellowing. **A Note on Image Quality: The quality of historic images are subject to the wearing of time, the capabilities of the original photographer, and limitations of period technology. History affords us no re-takes; we must content ourselves with what has been left to us. Please note that we do not attempt to fix, enhance or disturb the original image in any way, as we feel these eccentricities add to its historic charm. Thank you for taking this into consideration before making your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FPlTWc+FL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victoria","source_asin":"B00GYETSMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GYETSMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GYETSMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577231,"name":"Wine Opener, Vacuum Pump, Stopper: Wine Lovers Gift Box By Alexius: Perfect for Christmas, Anniversary or Wedding Gifts, for Men & Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YV9kh1goL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Includes: 1 x Wing Corkscrew Wine Bottle Opener 1 x Wine Vacuum Pump Saver 2 x Wine Stoppers 1 x Gift Box Grab a glass and enjoy the delicious taste of freshly uncorked wine at any time with the Alexius Wine Essentials Kit! Inside the gift-wrapped box are a set of four must-have accessories for wine lovers. The butterfly wine corkscrew opener has an ergonomic design that allows you to remove corks with minimal force and fuss. If you want to save the bottle for later, simply install a reusable silicone wine stopper into the end of the bottle and seal it with the stainless steel vacuum pump. It has never been easier to store fresh, delicious wine for up to two weeks! Best of all, the Alexius tools are all non-toxic, rust-proof, and dishwasher-safe, so they’re easy to use and built to last. The Perfect Gift for Wine Lovers Looking for wedding gifts that deliver quality, functionality, and elegance? The Alexius Wine Essentials Set is sure to light up their faces with a smile. From the luxe gift-wrapped box and bow to the premium tools stored inside, we take the time to make sure that every detail is in order. It’s also a great option for Christmas, housewarming presents, anniversary gifts, or just enjoying Wine Wednesday in your own kitchen. Say Goodbye to Bad Wine This set of two soft, flexible wine stoppers can be reused with the wine vacuum pump for years, so you’ll never have to pour out a half-full bottle again. With an airtight vacuum seal, the wine stopper prevents oxidation and maintains the fresh, potent taste that you love from the first moment of uncorking. Easy to Uncork Three-inch butterfly wings give you enough leverage to remove any size cork, no matter how long it is. Universal Design The two reusable wine stopper ends are made with flexible silicone and fit the mouths of most standard wine bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YV9kh1goL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alexius","source_asin":"B074FXZ1PF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074FXZ1PF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074FXZ1PF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
