window.products.push({"id":577295,"name":"Kai Pure Komachi 2 2pc Chef's Starter Knife Set - 8\" Cook's & 3.5\" Paring","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eVxEzkAIL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"The bright colors on both blade and handle make Pure Komachi 2 knives fun to use and they add eye-catching color to your kitchen. What’s more, those bright colors have a purpose. The color-coding helps guard against cross-contamination of food—for instance, by using the knife you just used on the meat to cut the veggies. The coated carbon stainless steel blades, hand-sharpened to a 16° cutting angle on each side, make quick work of most any kitchen task. The molded resin handles and comfortable and contoured for a secure grip. The blade coating is food safe and easy clean. While they are dishwasher safe, we recommend hand washing to prolong the life of your blade as well as the colorful blade coating. Pure Komachi 2 knives now come with a matching sheath for easy storage. The Pure Komachi 2 8-in. Chef’s Knife gives you the classic chef’s knife blade shape, but in a shorter, more agile length and a cool gray color. The Pure Komachi 2 Chef’s Knife is the one you’ll reach for every time you cook—whether you're slicing potatoes, chopping onions, or mincing herbs. Even in this shorter length, you'll find this knife handles small, medium, and even large foods with ease. Pure Komachi 2’s razor-sharp blade and comfortable, lightweight handle make food preparation a pleasure no matter what you're cutting. Every kitchen needs a paring knife. But when a paring knife is as handy and fun to use as this bright chartreuse green Pure Komachi 2 Paring Knife, chances are you’re going to want more than just one. The Pure Komachi 2 Paring Knife is the right knife for peeling, coring, and other detail work. With a slightly wider blade than some other paring knives, the Pure Komachi 2 Paring Knife is great for working on a cutting board, too. Mince garlic or small herbs quickly and easily as you enjoy this little knife’s sharp performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eVxEzkAIL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Komachi","source_asin":"B01N0WGUTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0WGUTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0WGUTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
