window.products.push({"id":577358,"name":"Giftgarden 47”x14” Black Full Length Mirror Aluminum Alloy Framed, Sleek Long Full-Body Metal Tall Mirror Wall Mounted or Hang Over The Door for Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HXYf9bFXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chic Black Mirror: The sleek aluminum frame and glossy black finish make for an elegant and minimal mirror piece. The real glass has great clarity without distortion. Sturdy Mirror: The back plate and mounting brackets are upgraded to be more stronger than old version! The explosion-proof membrane prevent the glass from bursting and flying off. This mirror was surrounded in styrofoam package. Full Body View: The overall size is 14x47 inches. Once you set it up, this full length mirror stands 47 inches tall, it will obviously reflect the entire body and should work for people of most heights. Hanging this full-length-mirror on the wall or over door in a compact smaller space to save floor space. Easy to Install: Come with necessary hardware of wall anchors and screws for wall mounting, 2 additional over-the-door hangers for door hanging. The assembly will be a breeze for you with an installation instruction. Nice Room Decor: You can install this beautiful full body mirror on the bedroom, foyer, hallyway, closet, bathroom, living room. Adding an elegant touch to your department and house room decor!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HXYf9bFXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giftgarden","source_asin":"B0BNKQK1L8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNKQK1L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNKQK1L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
