window.products.push({"id":577434,"name":"LCGGDB Seaside Polyester Picnic Table Fitted Tablecloth Cover,Tropical Sandy Beach Trees Elastic Edged Fitted Table Cloth,30in x 72in (6ft),for Christ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bTdlWVuCL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"Make your next picnic or camping experience simple with these fitted tablecloths. Don't mess with weights, clips or lost tablecloths again! Don't mess with another tablecloth blowing away while enjoying the great outdoors! With 4,6 and 8 foot Fitted Tablecloths you can be sure your tablecloth will stay secure and in place. Each corner has an elastic band (like a fitted sheet) and a deep four inch pocket so that this tablecloth will fit many table depths. Perfect for the six or eight foot plastic folding table you already own but they also work great at park or camping site tables! Those big, heavy cement or wood ones. Our tablecloths have a special stain and water resistant coating added so that wiping up spills is a breeze! Best part is, it's machine washable and dryable, made of a polyester fabric not vinyl! Durable and fade resistant, these unique tablecloths will be great at your next picnic, camping trip, backyard BBQ, any other outdoor, or in, use. The tablecloths come in 3 sizes, 24 inch by 48 inch (2 foot by 4 foot),30 inch by 72 inch (2. 5 foot by 6 foot) and 36 inch by 96 inch (3 foot by 8 foot). With 1000's of fresh and fun designs you can find the right tablecloth to match with any tableware and for any occasion. Environmentally friendly, no dye substance harming health of your family. Colors won't fade thanks to new digital printing methods. A perfect gift idea for your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, wife, husband and all other beloved ones with many of surprising designs.Find something for yourself and then pick one out for a friend!If you have any questions or concerns don't hesitate to contact us. We believes that color processing and motion stimuli are essential to both adults and children. Get outside with your family and friends and enjoy all our products have to offer. Color our world with color in motion!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bTdlWVuCL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LCGGDB","source_asin":"B09NN69XMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN69XMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN69XMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
