window.products.push({"id":577496,"name":"ZOOAOXO Beach Towel for Kids(51 × 31.5 Inch) - with UV Intensity Detection Lable Bath Towels - Sand Free Quick Drying Soft and Skin-Friendly- Elastic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jImNbM3YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're taking a morning shower or heading to the beach for a spa day, you'll want to reach for your favorite towel. But traditional towels are thick, bulky, take a long time to dry, and easily pick up sand and debris. If you're taking them out for a trip, they'll fill your suitcase in no time.Would anyone want to bring a wet and heavy towel like this? Nobody! To this end, after a long period of repeated experiments, the ZOOAOXO team finally made a beach towel that can satisfy you. This is a 51*31.5 inch beach towel, woven with 88% Polyester + 12% Nylon fiber.This beach towels are made of 250Gms fabric, which is thicker than the 200gms fabric beach towel on the market, so it will be more comfortable, feel better. Thanks to the new weaving process, it dries quickly while having good water absorption.The finer fibers and advanced weaving technology make it impossible for the fine sand to stay on the surface of the beach towel. You only need to shake it lightly, and the fine sand will go away. Won't bring annoying sand home.The ZOOAOXO team often sees the wind on the seaside, which makes people fascinated, thus ignoring the possibility of the beach towel being blown away. Therefore, we add a button design, close the buttons, let you release your hands and embrace the sea, Be at one with nature without worrying about the beach towel blowing away.The elastic band design can hang the beach towel for easier air drying, and it can also be rolled up for easy storage, saving a lot of space in your suitcase.This beach towel also uses a UV tag detector . Wearing a beach towel can block strong UV rays, protect your skin from damage, and keep your skin healthy and attractive.Great gift for everyone on the list.Practical and totally unique, our beach towels are the perfect gift for birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas and any special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jImNbM3YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOOAOXO","source_asin":"B09YLGLVJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YLGLVJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YLGLVJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
