window.products.push({"id":577575,"name":"L Tremain Crock, Antique Lavender","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hJxvFYBpL._AC_SL1081_.jpg","description":"The original Butter Bell crock keeps butter soft, delicious and spreadable for up to 30 days without refrigeration. Through the study of traditional and historical butter storage methods and hours of product development, L. Tremain, Inc. has created a line of butter crocks that are a tribute to the original French butter crock or \"beurrier\" (pronounced bur-e-ay). Made from durable stoneware or dolomite clays, the Butter Bell crocks will safely keep butter fresh and spreadable without refrigeration, odors or spoilage. The Butter Bell's unique design enhances butter's delicate flavor, while providing a practical and decorative solution for storing and serving butter. It keeps butter at the perfect \"spreading\" consistency by reflecting outside heat while insulating and cooling the butter. Flavor and freshness is protected by an airtight seal of water at the base of the crock. Water should be changed out every three days and replaced with fresh, cold water. Store the crock away from heat or sunlight. To use, firmly pack softened butter into the bell-shaped lid, pour cold water into the base of the crock and place the lid upside down back into the base of the crock. This antique lavender colored Butter Bell features a decorative embossed pattern that is hand-distressed to create a well-worn look. It is a beautiful addition to any kitchen or tabletop. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hJxvFYBpL._AC_SL1081_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L Tremain","source_asin":"B002QOYYO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002QOYYO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002QOYYO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577576,"name":"Pemberly Row Metal Model G Adjustable Twin Long Bed Base in Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":710.22,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rdwXtRs5L._AC_.jpg","description":"The innovative Model G Adjustable Bed Base glides towards the wall when inclined to keep you within arms reach of your nightstand. Multiple USB ports are located near the head for convenient charging and ambient underbed lighting illuminates the floor. There are 3 options to control the base using either a wireless remote control, phone app or voice command using Amazon Alexa/ Google Home with any smart device. The sleek design and latest technology ships fast to your doorstep within 5-7 business days.Adjustable Base:- Adjustable legs heights at 6\", 9\", or 12\"- Back-up battery power box included- Dual massage at the head and/or foot with 3 intensity levels- Foot Retainer Bar and non-skid fabric to keep the mattress in place- LED underbed lighting borders the underside of the base for ambient lighting- Sync Cables allow for functionality on independent sides, companion side or both sides; required for synchronized movements with solid King and Cal King mattresses- Four USB charging ports. Eight for Split King and Split Cal King Sets- Upholstered in a dark contemporary fabric- Wall Glide: ability for base to glide towards the wall when inclined; keeping you within arms reach of a nightstand- WiFi Adapter enabled; controls the base in multiple ways: A remote control app and/or by voice command using Amazon Alexa or Google Home. Smart devices are sold separately and are required for voice command functionality- One wireless 14-button remote control; batteries included (two wireless remotes for Split King and Split Cal King sets).Adjustable Base Positions:- Head up/down and foot up/down articulation- Pre-programmed positions: flat, anti-snore, zero gravity, and flat position- 3 custom programmable positions. Hold button for 5 seconds to program current position and go back to position with touch of a button.Features :- Materials: Metal- B","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rdwXtRs5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pemberly Row","source_asin":"B08W1HH6PV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W1HH6PV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W1HH6PV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577577,"name":"Meditating Mind by Naxart, 35 by 47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818SAJbPWxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features a watercolor image of a woman in a meditation pose. We are a group of creative professionals with diverse backgrounds in architecture, interior design, art, automotive design, and photography. All of us are passionate about their fields of expertise as well as art and design in general. Instead of a traditional approach of associating art with a specific artist we chose to create a NaxArt brand that represents our values and vision rather than promoting individual agendas. We also work with architects and interior designers looking for unique art work for projects ranging from a small NYC studio design to large scale corporate development projects. We also love our customers that simply discover NaxArt's collection of art and acquire our art to design their own homes. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818SAJbPWxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSOYX6O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSOYX6O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSOYX6O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
