window.products.push({"id":577632,"name":"Flax Linen Blanket 100% Pure Flax Linen - Queen/Full Size, Dark/Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y2g4wJVgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The linen blanket presented to your attention consists only of natural fabrics, namely linen and cotton. As you know, linen fabric has long been considered elite and the popularity of linen products is determined by many factors: -very durable material; -hypoallergenic; -does not accumulate electrostatic charges One of the most important is the bactericidal properties of flax. You can list the useful properties of flax as much as you like. One thing is clear - having bought this beautiful linen product, be sure that this blanket will serve you for a long time, and will remain fresh and clean for a long time. It can be used both as a blanket for a picnic and as a blanket for a sofa, and in any weather it will bring comfort to your home. Another plus when choosing a linen blanket is that the blanket is made by a Belarusian factory, and the quality and traditions of the production of flax products in Belarus are very developed. Care and recommendations: Delicate wash at 30-40 degrees After washing, air drying is advisable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y2g4wJVgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belarusian Flax","source_asin":"B07QR4P9CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QR4P9CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QR4P9CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577633,"name":"NUOMI Breathable Garment Bags Bridal Gown Wedding Dresses Storage Bag Long Dress Dust Over Large Cover Zipped Clear Bag for Home Travel, Foldable into","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cDoZnUPaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features Material: non-woven fabrics and organdy. Closure: zipper. Color: wine red. Size: 180*60*10 cm/70.8*23.6*3.9 inch. Package includes: One pack garment cover bag(hanger not included). Design Designed with clear window, allows you to see which dress is inside without opening. Function Ideal for suits, winter coat, long dresses, bridesmaid dresses, long costume dresses, grooms, tux, tuxedo and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cDoZnUPaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUOMI","source_asin":"B07X3SMWJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X3SMWJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X3SMWJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577634,"name":"Bathage Modern Grid Pattern Waterproof Fabric Shower Curtain - Natural (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618enFaVbhL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","description":"Modern Grid Fabric Shower Curtains by Bathage Bathage created their exclusive fabric because there was nothing on the market that was water-resistant, washable, but looked and felt like textile. Bathage products are elegant, simple, sustainable and functional. It’s airy yet sturdy, and is built to compliment your decor. Modernize your bathroom with a fresh new look with this waterproof fabric shower curtain by Bathage. Made of 100-percent polyester fabric, durable shower curtain drapes gracefully in your bathtub, while its artist-designed pattern creates a clean aesthetic that will transform your bathroom while still complimenting your decor. Transform any bath into a modern space with fresh minimal designs from Bathage. The shower curtain measures 71 x 71 inches for broad full coverage in most standard-sized tubs and showers. Along its reinforced top seam, the curtain’s rustproof metal grommets accommodate a variety of decorative hooks. The metal grommets promote easier hanging and long-lasting strength, as well as a polished look. The fabric is semi-opaque and will provide privacy in your bathroom, while still letting light into your bathroom and tub. Bathage’s fabric is waterproof, but you can choose to use it with a liner as well. Bathage’s fabric is nearly double the GSM of typical polyester fabric shower curtains. This means it will keep all water and soap where it is supposed to be -- inside of your tub! The fabric curtain is machine washable for easy care, as well as ironable or steamable on a low setting. The fact that it is washable allows the product to be sustainable. ABOUT BATHAGE: Bathage is a small artist-own and operated company based in Brooklyn, New York. All Bathage designs are exclusive to Bathage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618enFaVbhL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bathage","source_asin":"B0772V8L8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0772V8L8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0772V8L8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
