window.products.push({"id":577702,"name":"Nelton [60 x 80 inches Plush Throw Fleece Blanket for Korean Boy Band, Lightweight Soft Plush Fluffy Warm Cozy – Perfect for Bed, Sofa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61930rTUQjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✅ 【SUPER SOFT & COZY & COMFY】Nelton blanket is made of high grade 250GSM of 100% premium microfiber polyester that feels as caressing a piece of cloud floating in the sky. It offers the right balance of cozy and style to make sure that you don't just stay comfortable but also uplifts the look of your Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Bedding, Sofa, Couch, Car and Offices. ✅ 【PREMIUM QUALITY & DURABILITY】Soft fleece blanket lasts for long use and provides fade resistance better than others like cotton blankets. Microfiber blanket is NOT tend to bunch with time like cotton which has little elasticity to keep its shape. Highly durable and perfect for snuggling. ✅ 【EXTRA LARGE】 Compare with standard size ones, this throw blanket measured by 60\" x 80\" suits better for you to wrap up. No more worries about your toes. ✅ 【MACHINE WASH】Machine wash on gentle cycle with cold water,tumble dry at very low temperature, holds several machine wash and dry beautifully. ✅ 【WORRY-FREE GUARANTEE】Customer satisfaction will always exist and it always be our top priority. If you are not satisfied with the fleece blanket, just feel free to contact with us within 30 days to get a full refund without any problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61930rTUQjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nelton","source_asin":"B0BLNSMCH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLNSMCH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLNSMCH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577703,"name":"US Cities Text Map II by Michael Tompsett, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I9jlOZ4ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features cities in the United States in text. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I9jlOZ4ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKHE2P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKHE2P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKHE2P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
