window.products.push({"id":577733,"name":"Ovente MPA03 3-Cup Stovetop Aluminum Espresso Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m7u9fDTeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Simple, attractive and a very functional design all combined in this Ovente French Press. Durable, heat-resistant borosilicate glass beaker and a plastic handle and base. With safety lid that prevents splashing while plunging or pressing. Stainless steel plunger with mesh filter that enriches the flavor of coffee delivered directly on the cup. To use the coffee press, place coffee maker on a flat, heat-proof, non-slip surface. Hold handle then pull plunger up and out of the pot. Put the desired amount of coarse ground coffee (1 tablespoon is to 4-ounce cup). Slowly pour hot water (not boiling) into the pot. Make sure to leave at least 1-inch of space at the top to avoid spilling. Slightly stir the brew with a spoon (plastic spoon recommended to avoid scratching, chipping or breaking of the glass). Put the plunger on top of the pot (lid must face the spout opening to close off the spout). Wait for the coffee to brew for at least 4 minutes (do not press the plunger down). After a few minutes, hold the handle firmly then, with some weight from your hand, apply slight pressure on top and slowly push the plunger down. Slowly pour coffee on the cup. Enjoy your coffee. To clean the coffee press, remove the plunger from the pot then unscrew the filter assembly and clean each plunger and filter unit after each use. Clean the pot with soap and lukewarm water (use light pressure when washing to avoid breakage). All parts are also dishwasher safe. Caution: Coffee press is not for stovetop use. Avoid putting too much pressure (minimal pressure produces best results). Carefully wash the coffee maker. Use only medium to coarsely ground coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m7u9fDTeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B00746N08W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00746N08W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00746N08W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
