window.products.push({"id":577753,"name":"Golden Chef - Stainless Steel Mixing Bowl Set With Tight-Fitting Lids & Silicone Bottom With Bonus Whisk Nesting Metal Serving Bowls Ideal for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hKq-kbPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of four stainless steel mixing bowls with lids from Golden Chef Collection is great for mixing, making, storing, and saving all your favorite foods. Our high quality and durable design includes a non-slip silicone base to keep bowls firmly on the counter, and rust-resistant stainless steel for a beautiful brushed metal look that matches every kitchen.  GREAT FOR PARTIES:  Whether it's a big bowl of popcorn, a fresh salad, fruit, or homemade ice cream, you can find a bowl that’s just the right size in this set of nested bowls. At 1.75 quarts, 2.25 quarts, 3 quarts, and 4 quarts, you’ve got a bowl for all of your cooking, baking, and serving needs.  A BAKING MUST:  These lightweight bowls make baking easy. With enough bowls to apportion ingredients and mix your batter, bread dough, or icing, this set makes it easy to get the recipe right and clean up quickly. Our deep design controls splatter, and the easy grip lip makes the bowls easy to hold, pick up, and carry. LIDS: Keep prepared food fresh with the included, extra tight lids. The tailored fit creates a seal that locks in freshness. Easily store food in the refrigerator, freezer, or pantry with these temperature-safe bowls. And when they’re empty, stick them in the dishwasher for quick cleanup.  HIGH QUALITY: Created by kitchen experts, these mixing bowls have it all: non slip silicone bottoms, a compact nested design, and long-lasting stainless steel construction that will not warp, crack, dent, or chip like ceramic and glass bowls. The classy silver look also looks great in any kitchen.  CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We think our stacking mixing bowls are the best, that's why we’re willing to offer this satisfaction guarantee. If you don’t love your bowls, we'll fully refund your purchase. No questions asked. - Golden Chef Collection Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls - 1.75 Quarts, 2.25 Quarts, 3 Quarts, and 4 Quarts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hKq-kbPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Golden Chef Collection","source_asin":"B01M65JD5E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M65JD5E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M65JD5E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
