window.products.push({"id":577755,"name":"LifePlus Portable Evaporative Cooler, Swamp Bladeless Tower Fan Air Conditioner with Ice Cooling & Humidification, 4Ice Packs, 70°Oscillation, Low Noi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mgUxiH2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄Double water filling method - This air conditioning fan has two ways to fill the water, one is from the bottom of the water tank to add water, the water tank can also add two ice boxes. The other is to pour water from the top of the bladeless tower fan, the water will flow into the water tank, this design can avoid pregnant women and the elderly bending down to fill the water tank. ❄Remote Control & Top Control Panel - This evaporative cooler cooling fan has a remote control, which allows us to easily control the fan while lying on the sofa. At the same time, its panel control design is on the top of the standing cooler fan, which allows us to directly control the fan without bending over. This is a great design for the elderly and pregnant women. ❄70°Oscillation Function & LCD Display - This portable air conditioner has a 70-degree cooling oscillation function, which allows more people around to enjoy the coolness. At the same time, The top part of this room air cooler for bedroom has an Ultra HD Blu-ray LCD display, which not only displays the current temperature, but also displays the icons of the functions that have been turned on, such as timing, wind speed, oscillation, etc. ❄3 Wind Modes & 3 Wind Speeds - This evaporative air cooler has three wind modes: normal, natural and sleep. This keeps us from getting too cold while resting and also saves on electricity bills. The third wind speed is: Low/Medium/High. The combination of three wind speeds and three wind modes can meet our more cooling needs. ❄4 Ice Packs & Quality Assurance - This bladeless tower fan will come with 2 small ice boxes and 2 large ice boxes. After filling the ice box until the refrigerator freezes, put it into the water tank/filling port, press the \"cooling\" button and wait for 3-5 seconds, the cooler fan can produce cool wind. Our products have quality assurance. If the product is damaged or other problems, we will provide you with a full refund or reissue a new cooler fan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mgUxiH2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B0BW92363R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW92363R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW92363R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
