window.products.push({"id":577810,"name":"FAIZA NATURALS 7 Chakra White Sage 4\" - 3 Pack Plant Dyed Rose Petals with White Sage - Smudge Sticks for Cleansing & Protection - Incense Smudging Bu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iHrxILnGL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Let calm and loving energy find you with Faiza Naturals Set of 3 7 Chakra Smudging Sage Bundles! Faiza Naturals are an ethical natural products company that responsibly and sustainably acquires wholesome products. We use our direct ownership in California white sage farms to the highest quality outcomes. This matched with our meticulous approach to our sustainable sourcing and our deep sense of ethics allow us to provide our communities with only the finest cleansing sage for home bundles available. Bring peace and romance back into your spaces with our bundle of sage in a few simple steps... 1. Hold your burnable sage at a 45 degree angle and light with a match or lighter 2. Allow for a few seconds of burning before blowing out 3. Waft the continuous trail of smoke through your home, recite a mantra or maintain a calm intention 4. To extend the burn time, gently blow on the embers The spiritualism of our 7 chakra Native American sage bundles can be easily introduced into anyones everyday routine for an uplifted spirit and calmed aura. Used for millennia throughout Native American history, the traditionally trusted sage leaves for burning are believed to dispel negative energy, cleanse the air around you and your loved ones and also provide a truly calming aroma to any space. Our sage smudge sticks for cleansing make the perfect gift for any occasion! Whether you're looking for something to give the spiritual individual on their birthday or a loved one who has recently moved into a new home, our smudging bundles show just how much you care about the lucky person in question, in particular their wellbeing! Faiza Naturals 7 Chakra Sage Smudge Stick Bundle, Live Better With Nature","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iHrxILnGL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAIZA NATURALS","source_asin":"B0BJVPZJ7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJVPZJ7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJVPZJ7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":577811,"name":"Flask Hollow Book - The Constitution of the United States of America (Leather-bound) (Magnetic Closure)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FRV-0hY6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This leather-bound book has been hollowed out to precisely fit an 8.5 ounce Italian-made pocket flask (included). Add custom etching to the flask to make a great gift! - Hand cut from a real leather-bound book - Book features an exquisite leather binding, distinctive gilt edging, and a silk-ribbon bookmark - Precise cutout ensures flask wedges snugly in book without rattling - A strong magnetic closure prevents the flask from accidentally coming out - Pocket flask features a seal tight swing top, which creates a hermetic leak-proof seal - Hollow book constructed entirely with archival-quality adhesives - Appears like a normal book with natural page edges when closed (no glue on outside) - Book dimensions: 9.41 x 6.47 x 1.78 inches _______________________________________ Glass Etching: Have your own text etched on the pocket flask (optional). We use the superior sandblasting method which produces a rich, deep etching. Glass etching is permanent and will not wash, chip, or wear off. Makes a great gift! Choose from ten designs. See listing images for the designs. Please enter your design number and text to be etched on the flask before adding to your cart. If you do not want the flask etched (keeping the flask blank), please leave the customization box blank. Opting to have the flask etched will incur an additional fee. *Flask ships empty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FRV-0hY6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BookRooks","source_asin":"B019GRQC5E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019GRQC5E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019GRQC5E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
