window.products.push({"id":577870,"name":"Stainless Steel Saucepan with Lid, Triple Ply 1.5 Quart Sauce pan with Cover Induction Cooking Sauce Pot Perfect for Making Sauces, Reheating Soups, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iNFORG2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL GRADE SAUCE PAN - The hardworking mainstay in any kitchen, the high-performance saucepan is designed for everything from simmering sauces to cooking grains or vegetables. This pan is from GLENDAVENY's three-layer bonded stainless steel cookware line, which pairs classic style with modern practicality. The stainless-steel cooking surface doesn't react with food or alter food flavors, great for making sauces, heating liquids, cooking grains or vegetables in liquids and reheating. FAST & EVEN HEATING - Triple-ply stainless-steel construction (2.8mm thick) with a heat-responsive aluminum delivers 35% greater heat conductivity than other aluminum-clad cookware. Made with a responsive aluminum core together with 2 layers of durable stainless steel all the way around for the maximum durability and fast, even heat distribution. Highly polished 18/8 stainless steel cooking surface with starburst finish offers stick resistance and easy maintenance. ERGONOMIC HANDLE - Heat resistant stainless-steel handles with unique-designed thumb rests are permanently secured with 18/8 stainless-steel rivets to ensure a safe grip and stay cool on the stovetop. The exclusive handles (7.25 inches long) are designed for perfect balance and maximum control when lifting and pouring. Large handles are great for easy maneuvering and control even with oven mitts. RELIABLE EVERYDAY COOKING - Features straight sides and a narrow opening to assist with stirring a smaller surface area to hold heat and limit evaporation, perfect for making sauces or heating liquids. The bottom of the pan's interior is sloped slightly for easy stirring, and made of heavy-gauge stainless steel to help prevent sauces from scorching. The measurement markings inside make prep work accurate and easy for everything from simmering sauces to cooking vegetables. LASTS A LIFETIME – Features a tight-fitting stainless-steel lid to seal in nutrients and moisture for healthier, more flavorful results. The GLENDAVENY Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Sauce Pan is dishwasher safe for quick and easy cleaning, however hand washing maintains the luster of the stainless steel. Gas, electric, halogen, glass, or induction, this sauce pan works with all kinds of cooking surfaces, to give you the ultimate versatility. You can even put it in the oven or broiler (up to 500°F).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iNFORG2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"glendaveny","source_asin":"B09W5KW6QX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-577870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5KW6QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5KW6QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
